nebflow.llm.providers.AnthropicCompatSpec:
  + A1: strip leg sends thinking:{type:disabled} — the ONLY shape DeepSeek accepts as 'off' 0.273s
  + A2: strip leg no longer OMITS the thinking key for the deepseek family 0.002s
  + A3: history WITH thinking blocks keeps thinking:enabled and replays the block 0.003s
  + A4: the route banner reaches the wire (provider/model readable by the session) 0.002s
  + A5: every request carries a User-Agent (Cloudflare-1010 root cause) 0.002s
  + B1: a passback 400 is repaired in place — one retry with thinking disabled, then success 0.006s
  + B2: a NON-passback 400 is NOT retried (no blind retry on shape errors) 0.002s
  + B3: streaming retry emits ZERO chunks before the repair (seam-safe, no stitched output) 0.094s
  + B4: the 400 diagnostic names provider, model, request shape and response types 0.002s
  + B5: an edge/WAF 403 diagnostic says header problem, not credential problem 0.003s
  + C1: a non-streaming response starting with a thinking block parses (no Format, no crash) 0.002s
  + C2: an UNKNOWN delta type carrying text still yields TextDelta (text never dropped) 0.004s
  + C3: an UNKNOWN content block carrying reasoning becomes ThinkingDelta 0.004s
  + C4: thinking-first interleaving with an unknown event does not break the stream 0.004s
