nebflow.llm.HealthMonitorSpec:
  + fresh monitor: all candidates are Up 0.002s
  + markDown removes candidate from Up list 0.001s
  + markDown keeps ONE entry per candidate and REFRESHES the reason to the latest failure 0.003s
  + markUp restores candidate to Up list 0.002s
  + markUp is no-op if already Up 0.001s
  + markDown is per provider+model, not per provider 0.001s
  + waitForAnyUp blocks until markUp wakes it 0.503s
  + waitForAnyUp returns immediately if a signal was already fired 0.0s
  + late waiter after an early waiter consumed the signal must not hang 0.0s
  + two parked waiters both released by one markUp signal 0.204s
  + waiter blocked on an orphaned Deferred escapes via tick re-check 5.005s
  + filterCandidates preserves priority order 0.006s
  + full chain down returns empty Up list 0.002s
  + probe clears at the FIRST serving event — a slow thinking provider (never completes) still recovers 0.009s
  + probe keeps Down when the stream errors before any serving event 0.004s
  + probe keeps Down on a Done-only stream (no content — the real path fails the same shape) 0.004s
  + probe budget shrinks via nebflow.health.probeTimeoutSec (read at probe, never a startup constant) 1.009s
  + probeNow → 现读回绿: filterCandidates (the /model panel read face) reflects the clear immediately 0.009s
  + downCandidates includes Down candidates outside the default chain (kimi fix) 0.006s
  + downCandidates skips refs whose provider was removed from config 0.002s
